+# keys come from /data/opt/soloist/etc/keys.env, curl is Entware's /opt/bin/curl,
+# and Spotify API traffic goes through our own VPN proxy on the NAS (upstream
+# pinned it to a third-party IP).
@@ -22,4 +27,2 @@
